        "type": "correction",
        "reason": "Story [2026-07-07-010] states Le Pen received a ban on running for office, but the new verified fact indicates she announced candidacy for French presidency following this conviction. These cannot both be accurate - if she has a court-ordered ban on running for office, she cannot simultaneously announce candidacy. The new verified information contradicts the claim that she is banned from running.",
